        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-remember-and-show-23-60a73507-9342-4fa5-a250-17cda9d517ab",
        "text": "### A page can remember a choice.\nAsk AI to **save** what a visitor picks, so your page can use it again.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4d29be579bd7aa3779ec4854ce0b062b-exec-e04a4234-d775-4a71-9678-ca814003e0d1.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-remember-and-show-23-f84d3cc7-053c-47be-b86b-2c325cea5a74",
        "text": "### A click can save a pick.\nA **call-to-action** tells visitors what to do next. This button saves their choice.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/4abe7bca4b75ec62370fb0394a006e51-save-choice-panel-2.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-remember-and-show-23-2e31310f-67f4-4985-97b5-cb4e3737bf88",
        "text": "### Show the saved choice.\nAsk AI to display the saved pick as a **preview**, so visitors can see what they chose.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/07e3b733eb26e18bbc9aaf70a34867ae-exec-ae6ea831-28d9-40df-9204-d5e475926311.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-remember-and-show-23-fd44436a-8421-46e6-86fc-09e5d92ff1a7",
        "text": "### Make results easy to read.\nShow saved choices as **bars, counts, or previews**. Tell AI which display fits your page.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c30d97607f314c58577127624e413f2a-exec-fe93bb00-9c6c-4174-b555-6bbeaa3aeefe.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Discover how web pages can remember and display information. Learn that clicks can save choices, and saved picks can be shown again, often as progress bars, counts, or previews.",
